text = "

A supernova event has resulted in the formation of a rapidly expanding nebula.

85% of Solarian Space has been lost.

All communications and network infrastructure are down.

A final transmission from a station within the nebula reports that the nebula is affecting personnel by mutating them into hostile entities.

The Collective of Intelligence has been tasked by the remnemts of High Command to determine the nature of this phenomenon.

Your assignment is to review recovered Neurological Blackbox Data in hopes of understanding this new threat to the Coalition's Prosperity."
